---

### Step 3: Enable File Search Tool for the Agent

```typescript
const fileSearchTool = {
  type: "fileSearch",
  vectorStoreIds: [vectorStore.id]
};

const agent = await client.createAgent({
  name: "Smart File Search Agent",
  tools: [fileSearchTool]
});
```

---

### Step 4: Attach Resources/Use File Search in Threads

```typescript
const thread = await client.createThreadWithResources({
  agentId: agent.id,
